          <h3>The box model — spacing without guessing</h3>
          <p>
            The brief asks you to "change one spacing value" and "add a border,"
            but spacing is not one thing. Every element is four nested layers:
            <b>content</b>, then <code>padding</code> (space inside, around the
            content), then <code>border</code>, then <code>margin</code> (space
            outside, between elements). Drag the sliders and watch the layers.
          </p>

