          <span class="part-badge">Part 05</span>
          <h3>Selectors — how CSS finds the thing to style</h3>
          <p>
            Before you can style a navbar you have to <i>target</i> its parts. A
            selector is the address: <code>a</code> hits every link,
            <code>.cta</code> hits only elements with <code>class="cta"</code>,
            and <code>nav a</code> hits links <i>inside</i> a nav. Pick one and
